OL,3,GNEWSAWe've proven people wrong - and
OL,4,Anow ship our gym equipment all over the
OL,5,Aworld
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Greg Bradley started the his gym
OL,8,Fequipment company 14 years ago, someone
OL,9,Ftold him he would never sell outside
OL,10,Fthe island of Ireland.
OL,12,F"I remember thinking, 'I'm going to
OL,13,Fprove you wrong'," he said.
OL,14,F"Thankfully, we have been able to do
OL,15,Fthat."
OL,17,FBLK BOX is based in Newtownabbey - but
OL,18,Fit has secured contracts with
OL,19,Fhigh-profile customers all over the
OL,20,Fworld, from sports teams like
OL,21,FManchester United to chains like
OL,22,FPureGym.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
